This announcement will mostly be in German. The summary in English
is:

I've written a new Linux book for Linux newbies. In its 288 pages
it gives an introduction to SuSE Linux and includes topics such as
KDE, Office software (e.g. OpenOffice and KOffice), and hardware
configuration. The URL (german!) is http://www.esser-books.de/nach/
